cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If RBAi helped your research, please cite the RBAi CLI as below, with the version you used (rbai --version).
type: software
title: "RBAi CLI"
abstract: >-
  The RBAi CLI (the command rbai, npm package rbai-cli) brings RBAi, a
  research assistant for the life sciences, to the terminal, to scripts and
  to AI coding agents. It answers research questions with live biological
  databases, runs analyses in a cloud sandbox, writes literature reviews, runs
  Galaxy tools and works with protein structures.
